>## All literal types, in a canonical order
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term literalTypes = lists.concat [[model.LiteralType{`binary`}, model.LiteralType{`boolean`}, model.LiteralType{`decimal`}], lists.map (λx.model.LiteralType{float = x}) floatTypes, lists.map (λx.model.LiteralType{integer = x}) integerTypes, [model.LiteralType{`string`}]]
#^^^^ source.hydra keyword.other.definition.hydra
#    ^ source.hydra
